     "\\(\\left(\\frac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}\\right)'=\\frac{\\frac1x\\sqrt{x^2-1}-\\ln x\\cdot\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}}{x^2-1}=\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{x^2-1}}-\\frac{x\\ln x}{(x^2-1)^{3/2}}\\).",
     "החיסור: \\(f'(x)=\\frac{x\\ln x}{(x^2-1)^{3/2}}\\)."
    ],
    "answer": "\\(f'(x)=\\frac{x\\ln x}{(x^2-1)^{3/2}}\\)"
   }
